{
  "id": "99f31352-6f91-4724-ab0f-55f2569aaf2e",
  "name": "Start a tailored BriefGate client intake when a deal is won",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Start a tailored BriefGate intake when a deal is won\n\n**Who it's for:** agencies and freelancers whose CRM marks a deal as\n\"won\", who then need different materials from the client depending on\nwhat was sold — a website, a branding package, or content/SEO work.\n\n**What it does:** receives a webhook (from your CRM, a Zap, or any\nsystem that can call a URL), routes it by `deal_type`, and creates a\nBriefGate intake with the item set that matches that type of project,\nemailing the client their portal link right away. Anything that\ndoesn't match a known type falls through to a short general intake.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Add a **BriefGate API** credential to all four BriefGate nodes\n   below (API key from BriefGate dashboard → API Keys — use a\n   `bg_test_…` key first).\n2. Activate this workflow, open the Webhook node, copy its\n   **Production URL**, and point your CRM's \"deal won\" automation at\n   it (most CRMs support this directly, or via Zapier/Make/a native\n   webhook action).\n3. On the **Route by Project Type** node, check the `deal_type`\n   values against what your CRM actually sends (e.g. a custom field\n   or deal/pipeline name) and adjust the three conditions.\n4. Adjust the **Items** on each BriefGate node to what your team\n   actually asks clients for at kickoff on that type of project.\n\nExpects a JSON body with `deal_name`, `client_email`, `client_name`,\n`deal_type` — rename the fields on the BriefGate nodes to match what\nyour CRM sends.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-360, -440],
      "id": "a59a3476-6676-4d7d-ad78-f6aa960598bb",
      "name": "Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**BriefGate API credential**\n\nCreate one under each BriefGate node's Credential dropdown: paste an\nAPI key from BriefGate dashboard → API Keys. One credential can be\nreused on all four BriefGate nodes.\n\nUse a `bg_test_…` key while testing — it never emails a real client.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 500],
      "id": "315ddf5f-63d8-4c9c-835d-365d97be6213",
      "name": "Credential note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "deal-won",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-360, 220],
      "id": "b87c65f5-f96c-4fce-a379-51a4ce42a961",
      "name": "New Deal Won",
      "webhookId": "c2c207f5-9503-4635-94ea-373c787c5225"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c1-website",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.deal_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "website",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Website"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c2-branding",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.deal_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "branding",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Branding"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c3-content",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.deal_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "content",
                    "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Content"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [-40, 220],
      "id": "64529ccd-8f48-4f47-ac45-20fb9fd3a6ff",
